{"id":"huiliyi37__Tianshu-harness","name":"Tianshu-harness","owner":"huiliyi37","desc":"天枢harness是一个的终端编程智能体，它要回答的核心问题是：模型何以稳定地交付——目标不漂移、完成有证据、验证有闭环，不说\"应该修好了\"。为此它在模型与真实世界之间建立一层认知执行环境（CVM），把目标、状态、证据、资源、权限与终止条件从对话历史中外部化，由运行时持续管理。同时对deepseek v4极度优化。","lang":"TypeScript","langColor":"#3178c6","stars":1087,"forks":77,"issues":33,"d7":62,"boot":true,"vel":62,"score":15.558,"cats":["tools"],"lists":0,"hn":null,"license":"Apache-2.0","created":"2026-06-09","pushed":"2026-10-10","topics":["agent-harness","ai-agent","cli","coding-agent","context-management","deepseek"],"isNew":true,"descFull":"天枢harness是一个的终端编程智能体，它要回答的核心问题是：模型何以稳定地交付——目标不漂移、完成有证据、验证有闭环，不说\"应该修好了\"。为此它在模型与真实世界之间建立一层认知执行环境（CVM），把目标、状态、证据、资源、权限与终止条件从对话历史中外部化，由运行时持续管理。同时对deepseek v4极度优化。","homepage":"https://tianshuharness.com/","avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175001329?v=4","ghUrl":"https://github.com/huiliyi37/Tianshu-harness","defaultBranch":"main","watchers":1,"enrichedOn":"2026-10-08","langs":[{"name":"TypeScript","color":"#3178c6","pct":98},{"name":"JavaScript","color":"#f1e05a","pct":2},{"name":"Vue","color":"#41b883","pct":0},{"name":"Shell","color":"#89e051","pct":0},{"name":"PowerShell","color":"#012456","pct":0},{"name":"CSS","color":"#663399","pct":0}],"hnPosts":[],"awesomeIn":[],"starsSeries":[["2026-10-08",1087]]}